 skipped during tool-call sessions","comments":13,"created_at":"2026-09-08T10:56:37Z"},{"number":761,"title":"[Bug] `./start-all.sh` 无法完成部署：三处脚本缺陷导致 init-admin 阶段中断（v2.0.0, macOS + podman）","comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-04T03:58:26Z"},{"number":106,"title":"Suggestion: Add reproducible memory evaluation benchmarks","comments":5,"created_at":"2026-05-28T10:24:30Z"},{"number":1321,"title":"[Bug] 移除成员/删除用户后其 Agent 成为孤儿，任何角色（含 admin）均无法删除","comments":10,"created_at":"2026-09-10T05:45:44Z"},{"number":1545,"title":"hermes-plugin: agent_id lookup ignores agent_identity, so calls are attributed to the default agent","comments":7,"created_at":"2026-09-27T15:43:57Z"},{"number":1343,"title":"[Bug] store-pool.ts drops sendDimensions when building the embedding service — all embeddings fail silently and retrieval degrades to keyword-only","comments":7,"created_at":"2026-09-11T11:03:01Z"},{"number":927,"title":"[Bug] L0 embedding timeout silently degrades to metadata-only write with code:0 — MAX_RETRIES=0 leaves retry scaffold disabled","comments":7,"created_at":"2026-08-10T11:57:27Z"},{"number":420,"title":"v1.0.0 tag: OTel SDK version mismatch — `new Resource()` not compatible with `resources@^2.x`","comments":7,"created_at":"2026-07-07T14:29:34Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":1921,"title":"Aungko","comments":1,"category":"Ideas","created_at":"2026-10-29T05:11:11Z"},{"number":1920,"title":"Aungko","comments":0,"category":"Ideas","created_at":"2026-10-29T05:10:28Z"},{"number":1730,"title":"Kilo code getting query from the Memory Proxy","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-10-18T10:36:32Z"},{"number":1644,"title":"Code_Graph注册仓库是否支持subversion","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:06:31Z"},{"number":1638,"title":"不同团队之间的知识共享","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-10-12T02:29:08Z"},{"number":1565,"title":"[Question][v2.0.1][MemoryCore L0] Message ID、写入确认、timestamp 与 ID 格式 Contract 确认","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-09-30T03:31:18Z"},{"number":1524,"title":"这个适合给win配置吗","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-09-26T14:30:03Z"},{"number":1483,"title":"[FEAT] Is there an available support for `Antigravity` or any google harnesses ?","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-09-22T16:56:50Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"v2.0.3","tag":"v2.0.3","published_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:03Z","body":"## [2.0.3] - 2026-10-26\r\n\r\nv2.0.3 发布，相比 v2.0.3-beta.1 新增会话默认绑定与 Wiki 富文档，并把未单独配置超时的上游等待时间从 10 分钟改为 1 小时。同时修复 DeepSeek Harness 辅助接口、历史记忆时间格式、安装脚本、面板交互、Knowledge 启动，以及代理在 Redis 中断后不能自行恢复的问题。\r\n\r\n> **产品定位**：让 Agent 的经验、文档、代码沉淀成可复用资产，让下一位 Agent\r\n> 直接读档。详见 [README_CN.md](./README_CN.md)。\r\n\r\n### 🔁 会话默认绑定\r\n\r\n- 用户可为自己保存 Team、Agent、Task 的默认组合。新会话会直接使用该组合，不再每次弹出选择\r\n- 未设置时仍走原来的选择流程；默认组合失效时自动回到原流程，并说明原因\r\n- 可在会话中锁定或解锁该默认组合，避免后续会话被意外改掉\r\n\r\n### 📄 Wiki 富文档\r\n\r\n- Wiki 新增 Word、Excel、PowerPoint、PDF 等富文档的导入、预览和内容抽取\r\n- 原有 Markdown、文本和 HTML 导入保持可用；修复 Markdown 粘贴在部分情况下导入失败的问题\r\n\r\n### ⏱️ 长回复不再被提前截断\r\n\r\n- 未单独配置超时时，上游等待时间由 10 分钟改为 1 小时；已填写 `forwardTimeoutMs` 的配置保持不变\r\n- 流式回复连续 60 秒没有新内容时只记录告警，不再因此中断\r\n\r\n### 🐛 修复\r\n\r\n- 修复 DeepSeek Harness 的 token 计数、embeddings 等辅助接口返回 404 的问题\r\n- 修复部分历史记忆因时间格式异常而无法生成 L1 记忆的问题\r\n- 修复 macOS 上一键安装脚本遇到中文标点时退出的问题\r\n- 修复面板拖拽结束后鼠标样式和文本选择未恢复的问题\r\n- 修复面板标签页关闭键无法用键盘激活的问题\r\n- 修复生成的 User Key 复制失败时没有提示的问题\r\n- 修复 Knowledge 服务因 OpenTelemetry 依赖版本漂移而无法启动的问题\r\n- 修复代理在 Redis 中断后不能自行恢复、必须重启进程的问题。短暂中断仍短暂排队；时间稍长则立即降级，不把请求拖住","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":true,"news":[{"title":"TencentDB Agent Memory: A team-level memory hub for AI agents","url":"https://github.com/TencentCloud/TencentDB-Agent-Memory","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49184201","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-05","points":2,"comments":0},{"title":"TencentDB Agent Memory Tops 20,000 GitHub Stars in 90 Days, Launches Team Memory for Multi-Agent Alliance","url":"https://www.precedenceresearch.com/news/tencentdb-agent-memory-team-memory-multi-agent-collaboration","source":"precedenceresearch","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-16"},{"title":"TencentDB Agent Memory Tops 20,000 GitHub Stars in 90 Days, Launches Team Memory for Multi-Agent Collaboration","url":"https://www.prnewswire.com/apac/news-releases/tencentdb-agent-memory-tops-20-000-github-stars-in-90-days-launches-team-memory-for-multi-agent-collaboration-302850576.html","source":"irblog.prnewswire.com","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-13"},{"title":"腾讯云数据库 Agent Memory 开源 80 天 Star 破万，全新发布 Team Memory","url":"https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260806A0BBWN00","source":"腾讯网","lang":"zh","date":"2026-08-06"},{"title":"TencentDB Agent Memory 全球正式开源：让 Agent 沉淀经验，让人专注创造","url":"https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260514A03ZVV00","source":"腾讯网","lang":"zh","date":"2026-05-14"},{"title":"腾讯云开源TencentDB Agent Memory 最高降低61%的Token消耗","url":"https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/estate/integration/2026-05-14/doc-inhxwenh8756153.shtml","source":"新浪网","lang":"zh","date":"2026-05-14"},{"title":"TencentDB Agent Memory 适配 JEV 决策模型：让 Agent 按需调用团队经验","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE5ha01wUWdGLUJsMjQxYld0d0xVXzZzb05pVHpTWDhvN2tJMVlDcGNvX3FISk51c0Fyd3FYNVFVMzBCNEdQeWFobFBLSlJQLU5VUDgteV9B?oc=5","source":"腾讯新闻","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-13"},{"title":"TencentDB Agent Memory 新增DeepSeek Harness 桌面端接入支持","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE5qdHBxMi1kRy1iX1c0QjRZTWNXZUZyc1A2N3Q0RXJORVJLYlFhdUxTdVJ3dTBCeWZoZkZaZDBPbkh1QVV4TWR4SlpRVng0WHFvVE1MNXd3?oc=5","source":"QQ News","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-09"},{"title":"Agent 记忆，不能只靠聊天记录","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA3TnZ1SmpYM09GLTFhUWROS2FSeEk0VXBXWk5NOXo0Z1BYMnNRWWNpcjlSbU9xS3dndFd5bWphUUFhYzd3NlpWLUptT05kSUlDQmVWU3BkU01zNnZIT0E?oc=5","source":"InfoQ.cn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-08-04"},{"title":"TencentDB Agent Memory: Local Memory for AI Agents","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPVHhIMGszYndxWHRUSnZyU0ZwNkdoMlhRYXVhREhVYnI4ZTE4MjhWb2lHNWM4Rm1Hbm